sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as CLI / SDK Client
    participant APIGW as Amazon API Gateway
    participant API as Evaluator API Lambda
    participant DDB as DynamoDB
    participant SFN as Step Functions
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant EV as Evaluator Lambda
    participant MLF as SageMaker MLflow

    Client->>APIGW: Submit job (POST /v2/evaluators/{name}/jobs/evaluate)
    APIGW->>API: Route request (IAM auth)
    API->>DDB: Create job + report
    API->>SFN: Start universal pipeline
    SFN->>EB: EvaluatorTaskDispatched (app_invoke, task token)
    EB->>EV: Route by evaluatorName
    EV->>APIGW: POST /v2/reports/{id}/results/batch (private API)
    EV->>APIGW: PUT /v2/jobs/{id}/status (heartbeat / complete)
    APIGW->>SFN: Bridge callback (task token)
    SFN->>EB: EvaluatorTaskDispatched (one per scorer, parallel)
    EB->>EV: Route scoring tasks
    EV->>APIGW: POST /v2/reports/{id}/results/scores/batch
    SFN->>SFN: Post-process task (aggregate scores)
    SFN->>MLF: Log metrics + artifacts to experiment run
    Client->>APIGW: GET /v2/jobs/{jobId} (status from task states)
